                </p>
              </div>
              <div className="art:mt-16 art:@min-[1024px]/artemis:mt-auto">
                <h3 className="art:font-medium art:text-xl">{"Measured in outcomes."}</h3>
                <p className="art:mt-8 art:font-medium art:text-7xl art:tabular-nums art:tracking-tighter art:@min-[640px]/artemis:text-8xl">
